Natural language patterns Claude should recognize.

## Session Triggers

| Pattern | Action |
|---------|--------|
| "Let's work on {{PROJECT_NAME}}" | Fetch page, present state |
| "Continue {{PROJECT_NAME}}" | Same as above |
| "{{PROJECT_NAME}} planning" | Same as above |
| "Work on {{PROJECT_NAME}}" | Same as above |

